  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.3,
      209.91,
      453.1,
      247.78
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 2 of the Debt Conciliation Ordinanace (Chapter 81) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment \u201d) by increasing the number of members of the Debt Conciliation Board and by revising the selection criteria of the Chairman and other members of the Debt Conciliation Board.",
    "fonts": [
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.3,
      258.91,
      453.09,
      277.58
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 7 of the principal enactment by vesting the power of establishing Branch Boards with the Minister.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.3,
      288.71,
      453.09,
      316.98
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends section 8 of the principal enactment by vesting the power of appointing the Chairman and the members of the Branch Boards with the Minister and the revision of the eligibility criteria in respect of the members.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
