  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      159.1,
      276.47,
      401.65,
      301.81
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      160.1,
      319.47,
      401.63,
      357.81
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Debt Conciliation (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      160.1,
      362.47,
      401.63,
      401.81
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Debt Conciliation Ordinance (Chapter 81) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      182.1,
      419.47,
      401.62,
      472.81
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) of that section by the substitution, for the words \u201cshall consist of \ufb01 ve members\u2019\u2019, of the words \u201cshall consist of ten members\u2019\u2019;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      182.1,
      489.47,
      401.63,
      528.81
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of subsection (2) of that section and the substitution therefor of the following new subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.1,
      546.47,
      382.84,
      557.81
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) The Chairman of the Board shall be -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      165.1,
      575.47,
      401.61,
      614.81
    ],
    "text": "(a) a person who holds or has held a post as a Judge of the High Court or as a District Judge; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      165.1,
      635.47,
      401.61,
      674.81
    ],
    "text": "(b) a person who has not less than \ufb01 fteen years professional experience as an attorney-at-law.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
